# Wave W17-J (Frost Path — West Hall): frost wall — a dark ice-cave wall in the cavewall idiom, near-black blue bands carrying icicle points in its own face, hung where the hall’s breath froze on the stone (design: mirror-ice floors with old slide-marks, icicle pillars, the sliding dark). The West Hall’s own wall; its floor is the shipped icefloor, byte-preserved.
